Cell["\<\
A substrate is the graph a construction runs on. Every figure in this \
documentation is drawn on one, so an example starts with one line and no \
setup code.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"77fb283f-27cd-4736-aa01-0e47457062e4"],

Cell["The roster has five classes:", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"6c63c1d5-02ed-43cd-871d-1b3e3fa7475a"],

