     Cell[BoxData["True"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "6572b73b-34b0-48e5-8097-01a052df5df5"],
     " draws the substrate in its own embedding"
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"18a7d689-2421-4c12-9006-a6a924cd24a5"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
